# ART Mechatronics — redirects for Cloudflare Pages
#
# NOTE: Cloudflare Pages _redirects matches on PATH ONLY — it cannot match a
# hostname. The www -> apex redirect is therefore NOT here; it is a Cloudflare
# Redirect Rule on the zone (see DNS-AND-GO-LIVE.md). Netlify-style host rules
# were removed because they silently do nothing on Pages.
#
# Old WordPress site -> new site. Light map by design: the old install was an
# abandoned, unfinished theme with no sitemap and near-zero earned rankings, so
# only core pages, real industry matches and money pages get 1:1 rules. Section
# wildcards catch the rest so nothing dead-ends. Widen only if Search Console
# shows an old URL actually earning traffic.
#
# First match wins - specific rules MUST stay above the wildcards.


